## 🔐 Security Rules

- **Multi-org isolation** — Always filter by `organizationId`
- **Soft delete** — Use `deletedAt IS NULL` in queries
- **Audit trail** — Set `createdBy`/`updatedBy` on mutations
- **Input validation** — class-validator on ALL DTOs
- **Authorization** — JwtAuthGuard + PermissionGuard (when ready)

---

## 🚫 NEVER DO

❌ TypeORM queries in services  
❌ `findAll()` without pagination  
❌ Hardcoded organization IDs  
❌ `console.log` — use `Logger`  
❌ Untyped `any` parameters  
❌ Missing soft delete checks (`deletedAt IS NULL`)
